IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sg-periods`
IMPORT `sg-interests`
IMPORT `sgb2-s163-loans-to-connected-persons`

-- Tests for ss 163, 163A and 163B. Every expected value is written from the text, beside the assertion, before it was run.

§ `Facts for the s 7 interest tests`

`s 163 test facts: no interest at all` MEANS `s 7 interest facts` WITH
    `the person has authority (formal or informal, express or implied) to dispose of, or to exercise control over the disposal of, the shares` IS FALSE
    `property held in trust consists of or includes the shares and the person has an interest under the trust` IS FALSE
    `the person knows, or has reasonable grounds for believing, that the person has that interest under the trust` IS FALSE
    `the person has entered into a contract to purchase a share` IS FALSE
    `the person has a right, otherwise than by reason of having an interest under a trust, to have a share transferred to the person or to the person's order` IS FALSE
    `the person has the right to acquire a share, or an interest in a share, under an option` IS FALSE
    `the person is entitled, otherwise than as a proxy or representative at a meeting, to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to a share of which the person is not the registered holder` IS FALSE
    `the thing is a unit in a collective investment scheme that has been subscribed or purchased on an offer of units, or is issued for such an offer and held by the scheme's manager` IS FALSE
    `the person holds the share as bare trustee` IS FALSE
    `the person's ordinary business includes the lending of money` IS FALSE
    `the person holds the interest only by way of security for a transaction entered into in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money` IS FALSE
    `the person holds the interest by reason of holding a prescribed office` IS FALSE
    `the interest is a company's interest in its own shares purchased or otherwise acquired in accordance with sections 76B to 76G (including treasury shares)` IS FALSE
    `the interest is a prescribed interest of a prescribed person or class of persons` IS FALSE
    `the bodies corporate through which the person may be deemed to have the interest` IS EMPTY

-- The same, but the person holds a contract to purchase a share (s 7(6)(a): an interest).
`s 163 test facts: a contract to purchase a share` MEANS `s 7 interest facts` WITH
    `the person has authority (formal or informal, express or implied) to dispose of, or to exercise control over the disposal of, the shares` IS FALSE
    `property held in trust consists of or includes the shares and the person has an interest under the trust` IS FALSE
    `the person knows, or has reasonable grounds for believing, that the person has that interest under the trust` IS FALSE
    `the person has entered into a contract to purchase a share` IS TRUE
    `the person has a right, otherwise than by reason of having an interest under a trust, to have a share transferred to the person or to the person's order` IS FALSE
    `the person has the right to acquire a share, or an interest in a share, under an option` IS FALSE
    `the person is entitled, otherwise than as a proxy or representative at a meeting, to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to a share of which the person is not the registered holder` IS FALSE
    `the thing is a unit in a collective investment scheme that has been subscribed or purchased on an offer of units, or is issued for such an offer and held by the scheme's manager` IS FALSE
    `the person holds the share as bare trustee` IS FALSE
    `the person's ordinary business includes the lending of money` IS FALSE
    `the person holds the interest only by way of security for a transaction entered into in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money` IS FALSE
    `the person holds the interest by reason of holding a prescribed office` IS FALSE
    `the interest is a company's interest in its own shares purchased or otherwise acquired in accordance with sections 76B to 76G (including treasury shares)` IS FALSE
    `the interest is a prescribed interest of a prescribed person or class of persons` IS FALSE
    `the bodies corporate through which the person may be deemed to have the interest` IS EMPTY

§ `s 163(5) the family of a director`

#ASSERT `s 163(5)(b) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 163(5)(b) the director's spouse` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(5)(b) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 163(5)(b) the director's son` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(5)(b) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 163(5)(b) the director's adopted son` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(5)(b) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 163(5)(b) the director's stepson` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(5)(b) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 163(5)(b) the director's daughter` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(5)(b) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 163(5)(b) the director's adopted daughter` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(5)(b) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 163(5)(b) the director's stepdaughter` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(5)(b) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 163(5)(b) another person` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 163(5)(a) the interest of the person is treated as the interest of the director` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(5)(a) the interest of the person is treated as the interest of the director` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 163(3D) counting interests, voting power and approvals`

-- (a) the only reason is the indirect route through the lending company: not taken to have an interest.
#ASSERT `s 163(3D)(a) the director is taken to have an interest in shares in the other company or VCC` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 163(3D)(a) the director is taken to have an interest in shares in the other company or VCC` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (b) a company's shares: section 7 with the purpose s 163. No interest facts: no interest. A contract to purchase: an interest.
#ASSERT `s 163(3D)(b) the person has an interest in shares of the other company or VCC` FALSE FALSE `s 163 test facts: no interest at all` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 163(3D)(b) the person has an interest in shares of the other company or VCC` FALSE FALSE `s 163 test facts: a contract to purchase a share` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) a VCC: the answer of s 7 as applied by the VCC Act is the fact supplied, whatever the s 7 facts.
#ASSERT `s 163(3D)(b) the person has an interest in shares of the other company or VCC` TRUE TRUE `s 163 test facts: no interest at all` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(3D)(b) the person has an interest in shares of the other company or VCC` TRUE FALSE `s 163 test facts: a contract to purchase a share` EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (c) an interest in a share is an interest in the voting power it carries.
#ASSERT `s 163(3D)(c) the voting power the person is treated as having an interest in` TRUE 250 EQUALS JUST 250
#ASSERT `s 163(3D)(c) the voting power the person is treated as having an interest in` FALSE 250 EQUALS NOTHING

-- (d) approval after the loan does not count; approval before it: the paragraph says no more.
#ASSERT `s 163(3D)(d) the approval counts as prior approval for subsection (1)` (Date 2 5 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 163(3D)(d) the approval counts as prior approval for subsection (1)` (Date 30 4 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (e) the same for an arrangement under (3A).
#ASSERT `s 163(3D)(e) the approval counts as prior approval for subsection (3A)` (Date 2 5 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 163(3D)(e) the approval counts as prior approval for subsection (3A)` (Date 30 4 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS NOTHING

-- (3B) the arrangement's date.
#ASSERT `s 163(3B) the date on which the transaction is treated as entered into` TRUE (Date 12 3 2026) EQUALS JUST (Date 12 3 2026)
#ASSERT `s 163(3B) the date on which the transaction is treated as entered into` FALSE (Date 12 3 2026) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 163(3C) and the prior approval`

#ASSERT `s 163(3C) the requirement that the interested director or directors abstain from voting applies` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 163(3C) the requirement that the interested director or directors abstain from voting applies` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Approved beforehand with the interested directors abstaining: given.
#ASSERT `s 163(1) and (3A) the prior approval the section requires has been given` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- Approved beforehand but the interested directors voted, and not every shareholder approved: not given.
#ASSERT `s 163(1) and (3A) the prior approval the section requires has been given` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- (3C): every shareholder voted to approve, so abstention is not required: given.
#ASSERT `s 163(1) and (3A) the prior approval the section requires has been given` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- No approval before the dealing: not given, whatever the voting.
#ASSERT `s 163(1) and (3A) the prior approval the section requires has been given` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE

§ `s 163(1) and (3) the interest condition`

-- Exactly 20% of the voting power: 200 of 1000.
#ASSERT `s 163(1) the director or directors are interested in 20% or more of the total voting power` 1000 200 EQUALS TRUE
-- Just under 20%: 199 of 1000.
#ASSERT `s 163(1) the director or directors are interested in 20% or more of the total voting power` 1000 199 EQUALS FALSE
-- Together more than 20%.
#ASSERT `s 163(1) the director or directors are interested in 20% or more of the total voting power` 1000 450 EQUALS TRUE
-- No voting power at all in the other body: the test cannot be met.
#ASSERT `s 163(1) the director or directors are interested in 20% or more of the total voting power` 0 0 EQUALS FALSE

#ASSERT `s 163(3) the director or directors have an interest in the other company or limited liability partnership` `s 163(3)(a)(i) a company with a share capital` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(3) the director or directors have an interest in the other company or limited liability partnership` `s 163(3)(a)(i) a company with a share capital` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 163(3) the director or directors have an interest in the other company or limited liability partnership` `s 163(3)(a)(ii) a company without a share capital` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(3) the director or directors have an interest in the other company or limited liability partnership` `s 163(3)(a)(ii) a company without a share capital` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 163(3) the director or directors have an interest in the other company or limited liability partnership` `s 163(3)(b) a limited liability partnership` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(3) the director or directors have an interest in the other company or limited liability partnership` `s 163(3)(b) a limited liability partnership` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 163(3) the director or directors have an interest in the other company or limited liability partnership` `s 163(3) some other body` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 163(1) the bar`

-- Loan to a company in which the directors hold 20% or more, no exception, no approval: unlawful.
#ASSERT `s 163(1) the subsection makes the dealing unlawful` `s 163(1)(a) the company makes a loan or quasi-loan to another company, a limited liability partnership or a VCC` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Each of (b), (c), (d) likewise.
#ASSERT `s 163(1) the subsection makes the dealing unlawful` `s 163(1)(b) the company enters into a guarantee or provides security in connection with a loan or quasi-loan made to another company, a limited liability partnership or a VCC by a person other than the company` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(1) the subsection makes the dealing unlawful` `s 163(1)(c) the company enters into a credit transaction as creditor for the benefit of another company, a limited liability partnership or a VCC` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(1) the subsection makes the dealing unlawful` `s 163(1)(d) the company enters into a guarantee or provides security in connection with a credit transaction entered into by any person for the benefit of another company, a limited liability partnership or a VCC` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- An exempt private company: NOTHING ("other than").
#ASSERT `s 163(1) the subsection makes the dealing unlawful` `s 163(1)(a) the company makes a loan or quasi-loan to another company, a limited liability partnership or a VCC` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- A dealing of another kind: NOTHING.
#ASSERT `s 163(1) the subsection makes the dealing unlawful` `s 163(1) some other dealing` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Within an exception: the text says the section does not apply.
#ASSERT `s 163(1) the subsection makes the dealing unlawful` `s 163(1)(a) the company makes a loan or quasi-loan to another company, a limited liability partnership or a VCC` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Interest condition not met (the directors hold 19%): the failed "if".
#ASSERT `s 163(1) the subsection makes the dealing unlawful` `s 163(1)(a) the company makes a loan or quasi-loan to another company, a limited liability partnership or a VCC` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Prior approval given as required: the "unless" is met.
#ASSERT `s 163(1) the subsection makes the dealing unlawful` `s 163(1)(a) the company makes a loan or quasi-loan to another company, a limited liability partnership or a VCC` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (2): the foreign body.
#ASSERT `s 163(2) subsection (1) also applies to the dealing` `s 163(1)(a) the company makes a loan or quasi-loan to another company, a limited liability partnership or a VCC` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(2) subsection (1) also applies to the dealing` `s 163(1)(a) the company makes a loan or quasi-loan to another company, a limited liability partnership or a VCC` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 163(2) subsection (1) also applies to the dealing` `s 163(1)(a) the company makes a loan or quasi-loan to another company, a limited liability partnership or a VCC` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 163(2) subsection (1) also applies to the dealing` `s 163(1) some other dealing` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 163(3A) the bar on arrangements`

-- Taking part in an arrangement with both limbs, no exception, no approval: unlawful.
#ASSERT `s 163(3A) the subsection makes the arrangement or assignment unlawful` `s 163(3A)(a) the company takes part in an arrangement` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Arranging an assignment of a transaction that would have required approval: unlawful.
#ASSERT `s 163(3A) the subsection makes the arrangement or assignment unlawful` `s 163(3A)(b) the company arranges the assignment to it or assumption by it of rights, obligations or liabilities` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a) without the benefit limb: outside the prohibition's own words.
#ASSERT `s 163(3A) the subsection makes the arrangement or assignment unlawful` `s 163(3A)(a) the company takes part in an arrangement` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (a) without the other person's transaction needing approval: outside.
#ASSERT `s 163(3A) the subsection makes the arrangement or assignment unlawful` `s 163(3A)(a) the company takes part in an arrangement` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) a transaction that would not have required approval: outside.
#ASSERT `s 163(3A) the subsection makes the arrangement or assignment unlawful` `s 163(3A)(b) the company arranges the assignment to it or assumption by it of rights, obligations or liabilities` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- exempt private company, other dealing, exception, approval.
#ASSERT `s 163(3A) the subsection makes the arrangement or assignment unlawful` `s 163(3A)(a) the company takes part in an arrangement` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 163(3A) the subsection makes the arrangement or assignment unlawful` `s 163(3A) some other dealing` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 163(3A) the subsection makes the arrangement or assignment unlawful` `s 163(3A)(a) the company takes part in an arrangement` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 163(3A) the subsection makes the arrangement or assignment unlawful` `s 163(3A)(a) the company takes part in an arrangement` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 163(1) and (3A) as a regulative rule`

-- EXPECT BREACH. BREACH path: no exemption, interest condition met, no exception, no approval, and the company makes the dealing.
#TRACE `s 163(1) and (3A) a company other than an exempt private company must not make the dealing without the prior approval` "Acme Pte Ltd" FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 163(1) make a dealing of a kind in paragraphs (a) to (d) without the prior approval` AT 1

-- EXPECT FULFILLED. With the prior approval: nothing to forbid.
#TRACE `s 163(1) and (3A) a company other than an exempt private company must not make the dealing without the prior approval` "Acme Pte Ltd" FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 163(1) make a dealing of a kind in paragraphs (a) to (d) without the prior approval` AT 1

-- EXPECT FULFILLED. Interest condition not met: nothing to forbid.
#TRACE `s 163(1) and (3A) a company other than an exempt private company must not make the dealing without the prior approval` "Acme Pte Ltd" FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 163(1) make a dealing of a kind in paragraphs (a) to (d) without the prior approval` AT 1

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL. Standing prohibition, nothing done.
#TRACE `s 163(1) and (3A) a company other than an exempt private company must not make the dealing without the prior approval` "Acme Pte Ltd" FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH

§ `s 163(4) where the section does not apply`

#ASSERT `s 163(4) the thing done is within an exception in subsection (4)` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(4) the thing done is within an exception in subsection (4)` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) with the regulation limb missing: the "if" gate fails.
#ASSERT `s 163(4) the thing done is within an exception in subsection (4)` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b) not in the ordinary course of business.
#ASSERT `s 163(4) the thing done is within an exception in subsection (4)` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 163(4) the thing done is within an exception in subsection (4)` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 163(6) and (7) recovery, offence, penalty`

#ASSERT `s 163(6) section 163 operates to prevent the recovery of the amount or the enforcement of the guarantee or security` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 163(6) section 163 operates to prevent the recovery of the amount or the enforcement of the guarantee or security` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 163(7) the director is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163(7) the director is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 163(7) the director is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 163(7) the most the director may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST (`s 163(7) penalty` OF 20000, 2)
#ASSERT `s 163(7) the most the director may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 163(7) the most the director may be sentenced to on conviction` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 163A the cost of defending proceedings`

-- (2) the terms: the event for the kind of proceedings, and the 14 days.
#ASSERT `s 163A(2) the terms are the terms the subsection provides` `s 163A(2)(a)(i) criminal proceedings` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163A(2) the terms are the terms the subsection provides` `s 163A(2)(a)(ii) civil proceedings` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163A(2) the terms are the terms the subsection provides` `s 163A(2)(a)(iii) an application for relief` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The event term for the wrong kind of proceedings does not do.
#ASSERT `s 163A(2) the terms are the terms the subsection provides` `s 163A(2)(a)(i) criminal proceedings` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Right event, no 14-day term.
#ASSERT `s 163A(2) the terms are the terms the subsection provides` `s 163A(2)(a)(i) criminal proceedings` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (2)(b) the 14 days after the conviction becomes final: final on 1 June 2026 -> last day 15 June 2026.
#ASSERT `s 163A(2)(b) the last day on which the loan must be repaid or the liability discharged` (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS Date 15 6 2026
#ASSERT `s 163A(2)(b) the loan was repaid or the liability discharged not later than 14 days after` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163A(2)(b) the loan was repaid or the liability discharged not later than 14 days after` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 16 6 2026) EQUALS FALSE
-- The day it becomes final is not counted and an early repayment is in time.
#ASSERT `s 163A(2)(b) the loan was repaid or the liability discharged not later than 14 days after` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS TRUE

-- (3)(a) when it becomes final: not appealed -> end of the appeal period; appealed -> when disposed of.
#ASSERT `s 163A(3)(a) the date the conviction, judgment or refusal of relief becomes final` FALSE (Date 20 5 2026) (Date 1 9 2026) EQUALS Date 20 5 2026
#ASSERT `s 163A(3)(a) the date the conviction, judgment or refusal of relief becomes final` TRUE (Date 20 5 2026) (Date 1 9 2026) EQUALS Date 1 9 2026
-- (3)(b) disposed of.
#ASSERT `s 163A(3)(b) the appeal or further appeal is disposed of` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163A(3)(b) the appeal or further appeal is disposed of` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163A(3)(b) the appeal or further appeal is disposed of` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163A(3)(b) the appeal or further appeal is disposed of` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (3)(c) interest is within repayment.
#ASSERT `s 163A(3)(c) the payment is within the repayment of the loan` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163A(3)(c) the payment is within the repayment of the loan` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4) the application for relief.
#ASSERT `s 163A(4) the application is an application for relief` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163A(4) the application is an application for relief` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163A(4) the application is an application for relief` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (1) the exception: on the (2) terms.
#ASSERT `s 163A(1) the thing done is within the exception from sections 162 and 163` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163A(1) the thing done is within the exception from sections 162 and 163` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 163A(1) the thing done is within the exception from sections 162 and 163` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the right kind of loan but not on the terms: not within.
#ASSERT `s 163A(1) the thing done is within the exception from sections 162 and 163` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no such loan at all: the subsection says nothing.
#ASSERT `s 163A(1) the thing done is within the exception from sections 162 and 163` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

